    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8b478207c87dff431ebb90e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她们都将明年的「樱花赏」视为目标，\n因此安排她们到现场观赛，顺便为明年备战。\n此外，要带她们前往阪神赛场的就是我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f84dba8248e45e85a4af58e17e2fd6ef8e1afde2c9112222b8fd55e0104295e4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1131/storytimeline_501131113.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c03b89310fc63d888e1c305",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "唯独爱你",
